Crystallographic teaching pamphlets — IUCr (@mp-iucr: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mp-sources) { r_334MQS5KEVRJ17XKK0WKCP6KWX
International Union of Crystallography, Commission on Crystallographic Teaching. [Official Teaching Pamphlets and terms](https://www.iucr.org/what-we-do/education/pamphlets).

Read the individually named pamphlets used in this subject in full, including Hans Wondratschek's Matrices, mappings, and crystallographic symmetry, Ervin Hartmann's An introduction to crystal physics, and the diffraction/structure-analysis pamphlets needed by the chosen investigation. Identify their actual authors and revisions; the collection is not one uniformly authored textbook.

IUCr states that the electronic editions may be copied/redistributed for educational or research purposes and sets restrictions on profitable sale/incorporation. These terms are distinct from a general Creative Commons licence. Topics, selected titles/authors, access, and stated terms checked on 29 October 2026. Assign specific works; do not bulk-ingest or mirror the collection.

